<title>USA: Pennichuck Corp Q1 shr $0.14 vs $0.08.</title>
<headline>Pennichuck Corp Q1 shr $0.14 vs $0.08.</headline>
<dateline>NASHUA, N.H. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr		    $0.14		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net			    103			 56</p>
<p> Revs			 2,497		    2,906</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     746			726</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said the decline in revenues was because of a major land sale in January 1996, while there was no similar sale during the same period in 1997.</p>
<p>The company said its improved net income was because of lower operating costs in its non-utility, non-regulated business.</p>
</text>
